<title>USA: Rosenberg, Texas, $2.075 mln won by Legg Mason.</title>
<headline>Rosenberg, Texas, $2.075 mln won by Legg Mason.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker said it won $2.075 million of Rosenberg, Texas, waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.108 percent.</p>
</text>
